@startuml state-region
' Spec 002 — region lifecycle. Must agree with REQ-002-4 and REQ-002-6.
' No delete: a region is only ever hidden.

hide empty description
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor<<hidden>> #E8E8E8
}

state Active
state Hidden <<hidden>>

[*] --> Active : admin adds\n(or seed)
Active : offered to employers (003) and visitors (005)
Active : can be renamed (slug fixed)
Active --> Hidden : admin hides
Hidden : not offered in pickers or public index
Hidden : still resolves by slug; listings untouched
Hidden : can be renamed (slug fixed)
Hidden --> Active : admin unhides

note right of Hidden
  There is no delete.
  Listings keep referencing the region.
end note
@enduml
